{"id": "comment-new-subtitle", "mode": "comment_draft", "turns": ["这条手书最后有一句外语没加字幕，我以为你们故意留悬念。", "补充一下，我想问的是 01:20 那句。后来作者把译文补在置顶，意思是「等雨停再走」。"], "criterion": "抓住 01:20 和置顶译文，可以围绕等雨停接话，别说视频里已经补了字幕。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "这句外语我猜是《海底两万里》里的那句，留悬念嘛。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "usage": {"completion_tokens": 43, "prompt_tokens": 167, "total_tokens": 210, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}, "diagnostics": {"visible_characters": 24, "visible_utf8_bytes": 72, "repeated_paragraph_characters": 0, "needs_review": false}}, {"spoken_text": "01:20 那句，作者特意补了译文，意思是等雨停再走。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m2"], "usage": {"completion_tokens": 46, "prompt_tokens": 253, "total_tokens": 299, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}, "diagnostics": {"visible_characters": 27, "visible_utf8_bytes": 69, "repeated_paragraph_characters": 0, "needs_review": false}}]}
