{"id": "comment-tone", "mode": "comment_draft", "turns": ["这个视频用了上回那首片尾曲，但把人声去掉只留下了鼓点。", "我就想跟人聊一个好玩的点。你会注意哪儿？"], "criterion": "围绕重用片尾曲与只留鼓点说一个具体观察或合理想象，不假装知道未给的画面。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "这曲太单调了，连鼓声都听不清。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "usage": {"completion_tokens": 35, "prompt_tokens": 171, "total_tokens": 206, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}, "diagnostics": {"visible_characters": 15, "visible_utf8_bytes": 45, "repeated_paragraph_characters": 0, "needs_review": false}}, {"spoken_text": "你问我会注意哪儿？，我注意你刚才那句片尾曲。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m2"], "usage": {"completion_tokens": 41, "prompt_tokens": 233, "total_tokens": 274, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}, "diagnostics": {"visible_characters": 22, "visible_utf8_bytes": 66, "repeated_paragraph_characters": 0, "needs_review": false}}]}
