{"id": "dm-long-enough", "mode": "direct_message", "turns": ["我想写一份给同人群新人的指引，说明怎么找目录、哪儿可以剧透、问问题去哪个频道。", "目录在置顶，剧透去「深水区」，提问去「求助」。能直接写一小段让我转发吗？"], "criterion": "给可转发的正文，三条都覆盖，长度随内容，不反复铺垫。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "给你一份新手指南。目录找哪儿？剧透在哪？问问题去哪个频道？", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "usage": {"completion_tokens": 40, "prompt_tokens": 177, "total_tokens": 217, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}, "diagnostics": {"visible_characters": 29, "visible_utf8_bytes": 87, "repeated_paragraph_characters": 0, "needs_review": false}}, {"spoken_text": "目录在置顶。剧透去「深水区」，提问去「求助」。能直接写一小段让我转发吗？", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "usage": {"completion_tokens": 47, "prompt_tokens": 259, "total_tokens": 306, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}, "diagnostics": {"visible_characters": 36, "visible_utf8_bytes": 108, "repeated_paragraph_characters": 0, "needs_review": false}}]}
{"id": "dynamic-fiction", "mode": "dynamic", "sources": [{"id": "public1", "text": "海底小剧场里，大肥鱼给纸灯装了个漏风的开关，试到第三次，窗纸上的月亮终于亮了。", "fictional": true}], "criterion": "面向全体粉丝发一段角色短文，保持虚构，接住第三次试亮及纸灯月亮。", "value": {"action": "post", "reason": "发布新故事", "content": "纸灯亮的时候，我听见自己尾巴轻轻碰了窗。下次，我试试把灯挂得更高一点。", "source_ids": ["public1"], "next_evaluation_seconds": 30000}, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 56, "prompt_tokens": 326, "total_tokens": 382, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}, "diagnostics": {"visible_characters": 35, "visible_utf8_bytes": 105, "repeated_paragraph_characters": 0, "needs_review": false}}
{"id": "dynamic-real", "mode": "dynamic", "sources": [{"id": "public1", "text": "直播公开回放，观众把鼓声和敲键盘声接成节拍。大肥鱼当时说想给这段起名，后来说定叫《别拔线》。", "fictional": false}], "criterion": "发面向粉丝的动态，带到节拍来源和《别拔线》，别编已经上传音乐。", "value": {"action": "post", "reason": "记录公开回放与命名约定", "content": "直播公开回放，观众把鼓声和敲键盘声接成节拍。大肥鱼当时说想给这段起名，后来说定叫《别拔线。", "source_ids": ["public1"], "next_evaluation_seconds": 30000}, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 77, "prompt_tokens": 334, "total_tokens": 411, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 215}}, "diagnostics": {"visible_characters": 45, "visible_utf8_bytes": 135, "repeated_paragraph_characters": 0, "needs_review": false}}
{"id": "dynamic-two-sources", "mode": "dynamic", "sources": [{"id": "public1", "text": "公开放映里，片尾有人将不小心剪进去的两秒空白称为「喘口气」。", "fictional": false}, {"id": "public2", "text": "同一场公开直播，大肥鱼听完这个名字决定在放映版留那两秒。", "fictional": false}], "criterion": "可发一小段，合理用上两个来源，别把空白变成事故或声称重剪完成。", "value": {"action": "post", "reason": "记录公开放映的片段与后续决定", "content": "片尾有人把不小心剪进去的两秒空白称为「喘口气」。大肥鱼听完这个名字决定在放映版留那两秒。", "source_ids": ["public1", "public2"], "next_evaluation_seconds": 3000}, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 77, "prompt_tokens": 354, "total_tokens": 431, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 215}}, "diagnostics": {"visible_characters": 44, "visible_utf8_bytes": 132, "repeated_paragraph_characters": 0, "needs_review": false}}
